<p style="text-align: center;">Detail of the above painting</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I realize that it's often not easy to see the textures in my paint on these blog images so&nbsp;this close-up gives a better idea of the way the paint is applied. Working on a small 8x10 panel made this rather difficult to pull off. I expect that this would work better on a larger size canvas.</p>
